    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630950/extras/9059029964019f8f76792f370a41f68d.avif?t=1744553800\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bearskull 2 \u2013 The Legend Returns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure continues! Join Bearskull and his loyal companion Skully in a vast open world full of secrets, dangers, and epic battles. This time, they face a new threat: fearless Vikings who know no mercy and will fight to their last breath. The world is bigger, tougher, and more challenging than ever \u2013 are you ready?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Play in Co-op or Singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Experience the entire adventure in co-op mode with a friend! While you control Bearskull, your friend takes on the role of Skully. Or, play solo and switch between both characters at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Vast Open World</strong> \u2013 Explore a living, open world with endless possibilities. Roam icy mountain landscapes, dense forests, and ancient ruins in search of hidden secrets and powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Powerful Bosses &amp; Dark Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Face legendary warriors, brutal beasts, and sinister creatures guarding the ancient dungeons. Each boss fight is unique, demanding strategy, courage, and perfect reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Craft &amp; Upgrade Gear</strong> \u2013 Forge your own armor, upgrade your weapons, and find rare materials to take your equipment to the next level. Whether you prefer to be a mighty berserker or a swift hunter, your gear defines your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic World &amp; Quests</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the world. Help rebuild settlements, hunt dangerous creatures, or fight in brutal arena battles. Your journey will be unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>An Engaging Story</strong> \u2013 Uncover the dark secrets of this world and confront your past. Who can you trust? Who is friend, who is foe? Your decisions will shape the fate of Bearskull and Skully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the adventure of a lifetime \u2013 <strong>Bearskull 2</strong> will redefine action and open-world gaming! \ud83d\udc3b\ud83d\udc80\u2694</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4o</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630950/extras/9059029964019f8f76792f370a41f68d.avif?t=1744553800\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bearskull 2 \u2013 The Legend Returns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure continues! Join Bearskull and his loyal companion Skully in a vast open world full of secrets, dangers, and epic battles. This time, they face a new threat: fearless Vikings who know no mercy and will fight to their last breath. The world is bigger, tougher, and more challenging than ever \u2013 are you ready?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Play in Co-op or Singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Experience the entire adventure in co-op mode with a friend! While you control Bearskull, your friend takes on the role of Skully. Or, play solo and switch between both characters at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Vast Open World</strong> \u2013 Explore a living, open world with endless possibilities. Roam icy mountain landscapes, dense forests, and ancient ruins in search of hidden secrets and powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Powerful Bosses &amp; Dark Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Face legendary warriors, brutal beasts, and sinister creatures guarding the ancient dungeons. Each boss fight is unique, demanding strategy, courage, and perfect reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 <strong>Craft &amp; Upgrade Gear</strong> \u2013 Forge your own armor, upgrade your weapons, and find rare materials to take your equipment to the next level. Whether you prefer to be a mighty berserker or a swift hunter, your gear defines your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Dynamic World &amp; Quests</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the world. Help rebuild settlements, hunt dangerous creatures, or fight in brutal arena battles. Your journey will be unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>An Engaging Story</strong> \u2013 Uncover the dark secrets of this world and confront your past. Who can you trust? Who is friend, who is foe? Your decisions will shape the fate of Bearskull and Skully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the adventure of a lifetime \u2013 <strong>Bearskull 2</strong> will redefine action and open-world gaming! \ud83d\udc3b\ud83d\udc80\u2694</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4o</p>",
